 "v1_problem": "Since August 2026 Lakeside's billing dispute ticket volume has roughly doubled (E-03), not because ticket response is slow — response times remain within the 3.0-day SLA (E-01), contradicting the initial framing (CL-01) — but because manual field meter-read routes for 9200 accounts are completing at 0.88 against a 0.95 target (E-05), leaving reads missing for billing's estimate-substitution step (process P-M2C), and a substantial share of disputed bills (1240 of 3025, ~41%) are tied to these ESTIMATED reads rather than ACTUAL reads (E-02): customers receiving estimate-substituted bills are disproportionately disputing them, driving the surge.",
